Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your luck has increased by three.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.97,0:01:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.99,0:01:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't any different from real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in this world, it's like\NI can never attain my dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's starting to come into view.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's a town!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you dawdling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fluctuations in your\Nmood are really extreme.
