Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sort of has the feel of a\Nmarketplace in Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always liked this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like this, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need you to explain why I have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to wear a bag on my\Nhead to enter this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To prevent a pandemic just put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're treating me like some\Nkind of zombie or disease
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making me stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate this world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, would you be interested\Nin buying this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to return to the modern age.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to eat ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go. Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guardian deity's pelt\Nearned us ten silver pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't think\Nit would sell for much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.45,0:03:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't had a hole in the\Nchest, it would have been double.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to think about the\Nkilling method next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could always\Njust wear that thing from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinguuji! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this super cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, let's buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think would use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a weapons shop! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna cut down all\Nthe things, I need a blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I gave you a birthday present\Nonce to encourage you to cook more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it has lain unused and unloved in the\Ndepths of your kitchen collecting dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which I should mention is beyond shameful\Nfor Damascus steel kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, this topic was a landmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that aside, you need a sword\Nin the fantasy world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I did want something\Nother than the kitchen knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.59,0:04:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're actual swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have whetstones and knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly fair that\Nall the shopping's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything you need all you have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do is let me know\Nyes if there's anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need let me know are you glitching i\Njust said i wanted this i'll be using this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knife for hunting and i'd like a whetstone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To sharpen it, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.89,0:04:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.45,0:04:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you just did is exactly the type of action
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I despise the most. I'm sorry.\NAs long as you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand that was close i nearly bought
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sword unparalleled\Nbeauty that physical
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.94,0:04:55.64,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnPainted Lady\b0\fax0.5\c&H050506&\blur0.8\fs115\pos(1234.67,146.94)\1a&HDE&\t(16,512,\1a&H4F&)\t(559,900,\1a&H00&)}Unparalleled Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appearance is affecting the inner self as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well i must exercise\Nrestraint so tachibana
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't head in a bad direction traveling\Nincognito hmm sorry it's obvious she's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hiding her face which just makes her stand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out more so i thought\Ni'd ask really Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.19,0:05:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you think too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just happen to have the perfect\Nthing on hand if you're interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enchanted hair ornament.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns people's eyes away. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you have it for cheap too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just 300 gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the knife and whetstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that would be nearly all\Nthe gold coins the villagers gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.99,0:05:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't this be a good\Ntime to use this face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, to haggle down the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you could, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I think that we might drive\Nthe shopkeeper to bankruptcy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could make it\Njust a little bit cheaper for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.55,0:05:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then shall I give you my entire shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take the deed to my store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I really don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something else you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.61,0:06:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What must I give you for you to marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shopkeep, apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you'd forget this conversation...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I doing? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hair ornament earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you still sell it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was that stunning beauty just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like seeing a dream\Nthat had come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd gladly worship a\Ngoddess like her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ended up buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, it would be a problem\Nif we couldn't go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is sort of a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Jinguji, I've just realized\Nsomething pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can make this door appear and\Ndisappear whenever you want, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I were to stay inside\Nand you were to travel alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no need for me\Nto walk too, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're not the kind\Nof person who would make
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their best friend work while\Nyou rested comfortably,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you'd\Nalready figured this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one of us can take it easy, there's no\Npoint in both of us exhausting ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's suppose that\NI do travel by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd make the door disappear\Nand you'd be in there all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, if I die\Nwhile the door is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think happens to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then just leave the door out\Nlike this can't you just think
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if someone enters will you be\Nable to deal with them alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's magic in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a lock\Nwill make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, when I go out, all I do is cause\Nproblems for all kinds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now people aren't\Neven looking at me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only directs eyes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be less effective\Nif you're worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Jingiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm free of this paper bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So satisfying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.73,0:08:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this guy stands out a\Nlot in his own way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got refined features,\Nand he's wearing a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be better for\Nhim to change his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you smiling because\Nyou're so incredibly popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure you've noticed as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's following us, and they're\Nemitting a tremendous bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally didn't notice at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're surprisingly bad at\Nconcealing their presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you can't feel\Nthat aura of bloodlust?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.61,0:09:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normal people can't sense that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What even are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know for a fact you're\Nfollowing us, so just show yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing off your flirty face right\Nin the middle of town for all to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how tough we had it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after what you put us\Nthrough the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sneaky wench? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that group of\Nbandits from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, don't get me wrong, I was\Npretty sure you wouldn't remember us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I figured if we waited at the nearest\Ntown, we'd run into you eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the fire was set,\Neveryone got out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the flames moved so fast,\Nwe ended up scattered all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't mention my hair,\NI'm embarrassed enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.97,0:09:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, your hair was not\Nwhat I was thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, big bro.\NYeah, you're as beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as ever i may just fall\Nin love big bro that's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:09:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something only a guy who's\Nalready in love would
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say don't look at her\Nshield your eyes is this a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sketch so once they're\Naware of you they can be
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,charmed kill the one with\Nthe glasses and then we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can sell the woman to the\Nnobles die for the sake
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of her happiness i'm\Nexperiencing some deja vu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please to meet you, Mr. Schwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's safe to assume\Nthat you are also a hero then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you appear to know what a Soot is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does that mean you've come here\Nfrom the same world as we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure to tell you that I am\NSchwarz von Lichtenstein Lohengramm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.19,0:10:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will become a great hero in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but your name is\Nso long I kind of spaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you say it one more time?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.92,0:11:01.93,Signs,text; center,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord1.5\fax.15\blur0.65\c&HD2801F&\3c&HD2801F&\fnAdelia Shawn\pos(1121.22,437.96)}Huh?
