Dialogue: 8,0:10:56.93,0:11:01.93,Signs,title,0,0,0,isekai,{\c&H9972FD&\blur0.65\fnDelight Candles\bord0\shad0\fs35\pos(446.9,505.85)}i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:10:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still my pleasure to tell you I am\NSchwarz von Liechtenstein Lohengrang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my honor to have been\Nsummoned to this world as a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you put on and take off the cloak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what was your name in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've left it behind in\Nthat old world forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a new man, so just call me\NSchwarz von Liechtenstein-Lohengrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been summoned here\Nto this world as a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's nice, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want all the trouble of reaching out to\Nyou, so what's with the cold shoulder now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have other business with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we don't have any with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's take a breath, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't stand seeing him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems obvious that he introduced\Nhimself with a false name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we must be careful not to\Ndivulge too much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it proves difficult, throw in\Nfake details from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a false name so much as...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schwarz von Lichtenstein-Lohengrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but please call me Schwartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Watanabe, and her name's Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Audrey, tell me, are you from this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.05,0:12:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, how can I explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for staring\Nat your face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be able to extricate yourself\Nfrom that state on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you certainly aren't the average person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the standard you\Nwant to judge him by?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.95,0:12:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two, like, a couple? Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I ask something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's obviously\Nmuch younger than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem more like a father\Nand daughter than a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, the two of us are a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.55,0:13:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real couple, I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We swore our love that night, or have\Nyou forgotten already? I don't recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't deny it, you're the one who\Ntold me to make it fake detail!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who says that out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, no matter which way you look\Nat it, pretending seems natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want people thinking\NI'm in a relationship with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, don't say that\Nyou're gonna hurt my feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really feel hurt? Why\Nis that? Uh... Uh... Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean anything weird,\Nif that's what you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.11,0:14:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the man is looking after\Nher like a father might,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now the daughter has developed\Nromantic feelings for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the trope we're going with here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen it in light novels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two must have overcome\Nso many obstacles together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've lost their homelands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their parents have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now their lives are saved and their\Nfrozen hearts have begun to melt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in that case, I don't know why\NWatanabe would deny his romantic feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you left a fiancé behind\Nin the other world or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible a competent\Nprofessional guy like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this there's no way he\Ndoesn't have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling Watanabe\Nwill disappear without
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a word once their journey comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when she realizes that Audrey\Nis the one who will be hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For her sake there is only one course\Nof action I can take kind father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I am not her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now allow me to call you father-in-law.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.55,0:15:05.76,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\fs260\blur0.75\c&HF5F5F5&\fnRevans Medium\b0}Fa{\alpha&HFF&}ther-in-law
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.55,0:15:09.42,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H040404&}m 37 157 l 1890 157 1890 851 37 851
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.76,0:15:05.97,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\fs260\blur0.75\c&HF5F5F5&\fnRevans Medium\b0}Father{\alpha&HFF&}-in-law
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.97,0:15:06.18,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\fs260\blur0.75\c&HF5F5F5&\fnRevans Medium\b0}Father-in{\alpha&HFF&}-law
Dialogue: 2,0:15:06.18,0:15:09.42,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\fs260\blur0.75\c&HF5F5F5&\fnRevans Medium\b0}Father-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you actually understand nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a firm believer that people\Nwho are unrelated by blood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can still have an excellent\Nparent-child relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with you on that point, but still\Nconfused about why you'd mention it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an excellent father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you must be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can a man who's obviously weaker\Nthan me still protect my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've been charmed, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.07,0:15:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally found an\Nopponent worthy of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenge you, Watanabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And know this, I'm going to surpass you\Neasily and take Audrey for my very own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Audrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cry out my holy sword, Gram!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gram?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the magic sword in Norse mythology?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought there were tales that it cursed\Nits wielder to death, but he said holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.61,0:15:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, just let the poor guy have this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:15:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the holy sword, Gram.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.23,0:16:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sword is insanely sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's off-putting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we hadn't dodged,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our heads would have been doing\Nthat same little slidey thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our opponent seems quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can dodge that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.93,0:16:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd expect no less, dear father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got some nerve saying that when\Nhe came gunning to kill the noobies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never used it before\Nin that cutting power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broken out into a cold sweat, I\Nalmost cut Audrey right in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined it was\Nsomething of this caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll destroy my whole town!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any way I can avoid a fight\Nand still convince father to trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold myself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.77,0:16:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since\NI've felt this excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dark powers dominate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I suppose it's time now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make them think I've got\Nmore than this and threaten them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please buy into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, just buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that wasn't you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is! Thank you,\NAudrey! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't serious at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, why not show me\Nwhat Sirius looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no going back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my single Sirius blow! Receive it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't give me that, receive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've apprehended the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, arrest the two that are\Nstuck in the ground as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the neighborhood watch for\Nthis town in the Merix territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm arresting you under suspicion\Nof the destruction of buildings
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your cooperation not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only did what was right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then what else you two\Nwill be important witnesses
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you accompany me\Nto our command post?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.87,0:18:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a hero who's been summoned\Nhere to save this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, do you have any idea how\Nmany of those we've had this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a false name, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not a false name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my soul name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's that part of you\Nthat's causing these problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heroes and such are nothing more\Nthan hopeful rumors, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumors about oracles saying things\Nlike the lord of evil will rise again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that goddesses will call\Nforth heroes to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord of evil? Goddesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more like that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you have to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you prove that you're a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually have that! How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.77,0:19:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the proof which the\Ngoddess has bestowed upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or something like that, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it does seem to be the\Nseal of the goddess of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should prove once and for all that\NI am a hero summoned here by a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,committed perjury!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crime upon crime, you poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forging the seal of a goddess\Nis forbidden under the covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the goddesses all have\Nsome kind of seal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe I've got one too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like\Nit from what I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.65,0:19:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember seeing anything like that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I took a bath, either\Nmaybe it's in a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't usually see
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on is it there or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.81,0:20:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My underarms?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I tried to hold back a nosebleed\Nbut it came out of my mouth instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it even possible to\Nhold back a nosebleed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite lively in here today, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord, what do I owe the honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I heard a rumor going around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That there was someone strong enough to\Ncut down a building with a single strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the person in question?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His treatment seems pretty harsh for\Nthe amount of damage he's caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.41,0:20:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one was hurt after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one was hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lack of casualties aside, there is\Nno defense on the matter of the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to pass himself off as\Na priest, in short, is perjury.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:21:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.53,0:21:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the case that the\Nseal is authentic, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means that this man simply\Nneeds to prove that he's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.97,0:21:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let us see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hero who would save the world\Nwould naturally be very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have him show us\Nhis abilities as a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.09,0:21:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You replied much too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's odd for me to be the one to say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but shouldn't you listen\Nto the details first?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.81,0:21:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think I'd so quickly find an\Nopportunity to show my true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the type who\Ndoesn't listen to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, what is this? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mission-based quest like\Nyou get in games all the time!
