Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they do exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems they really exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Merix territory is\Na big distribution hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of goods move through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, of course, robbers often appear\Nalong the nearby roads lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:22:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the living armor that's been\Nstealing our people's magical items.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.59,0:22:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is my request of you!
